---
title: "Safety monitor"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: idle
    lg1: running
    lg2: stopped
  }
  class lg0 tan
  class lg1 teal
  class lg2 orange
  s0: Pump off
  s1: Running
  s2: Running, sensor has gone quiet
  s3: Stopped by the monitor
  s4: Running, near the time limit
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the pump turns on
  s1 --> s0: the pump turns off
  s1 --> s2: the sensor goes quiet
  s2 --> s0: the pump turns off
  s2 --> s1: a sensor sample arrives
  s2 --> s3: the quiet sensor trips the stop or time passes
  s1 --> s4: time passes
  s3 --> s0: the stop is confirmed
  s4 --> s0: the pump turns off
  s4 --> s3: time passes
  s4 --> s2: the sensor goes quiet
  s2 --> s4: a sensor sample arrives
  class s0 tan
  class s1 teal
  class s2 teal
  class s3 orange
  class s4 teal
